Last rebase: 2026-11-11

Categories of modification
--------------------------
1. Satellite Django app `plane_ext` at apps/api/plane/ext/ with its own tables
   and migrations (workspace-scoped custom properties, feature flags, embed
   hand-off tokens). Upstream models and migrations are untouched.
2. Settings overlay apps/api/plane/settings/bp.py selected by
   DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE (no edit to upstream settings).
3. Frontend extension code under apps/web/core/ext/ and apps/web/app/ext/,
   registered through upstream's `extended.*` seam files.
4. Build-time patch files under patches/ (listed in patches/README.md),
   applied to a small, counted set of upstream files.
5. CI, release and deployment files; removal of upstream CI workflows.

No Plane Commercial Edition code, images or UI were consulted or copied.
This fork contains no licensing, plan or paid-tier code.

Complete corresponding source
-----------------------------
The complete source of any running image is this repository at the git tag
matching the image's `org.opencontainers.image.version` label.
